    "commit_body": "Score.calculate_overall_score, calculate_scores_batched, recalculate_scores_batched,\nand simulator.py now route weekly inputs through RollingWeeklyIndicator (daily-keyed\n14-bar 5-day ladder ending T-1) by default. Calendar weekly path remains accessible\nvia WEEKLY_MODE='calendar' env var override for revert.\n\nValidation pre-ship (experiments/rolling_weekly/FINDINGS.md):\n- P0 faithful per-trade WR15 (10% sample): 80+ +4.51pp, 85+ +3.14pp, 75+ +1.87pp\n- Stability: Mon |\u0394overall| 6.245 \u2192 4.384 (-30% raw / -15% proper)\n- Distribution: rolling vs calendar raw RSI/MACD correlate +0.96-0.99\n- COHR-class intra-day swing: eliminated by construction (ladder excludes today's bar)\n\nTest updates:\n- test_rolling_weekly.py: assertions flipped to expect rolling default; calendar mode\n  now tested via env override path\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
